    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a simulation spoof game that is pure mischief.</h2>You will play as a chicken and control your chicken to explore the town. You can choose to wreak havoc on the town; you can also go to control the cowboy on his precious white horse to fly in the air; you can also go to defeat the wolves, embark on an adventure to defeat the dragon that threatens the four directions.<br>You can do a lot of things, you have a lot of time, the white horse will never get old, the dragon will never eat the princess. You just need to take your time and enjoy your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>Scary chickens (that's you)<br>Exclusive chicken call button (!!!)<br>Attack behavior (wreak havoc on the town)",
